{"availability":"available","full":"qnbs/WorldScript-Studio","name":"WorldScript-Studio","description":"🖋️ AI-powered writing studio for authors & screenwriters. Story planning, character & world building, AI assistants, offline PWA + desktop app with strong privacy focus.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":21,"forks":7,"created":"2025-11-03T16:20:10Z","updated":"2026-10-04T07:51:17Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://worldscript-studio.vercel.app/","topics":["ai-writing","ai-writing-assistant","author-tools","character-development","creative-writing","creative-writing-ai","local-ai","novel-writing","offline-first","pwa","story-planning","tauri","world-building","writing-app"],"demo":"https://qnbs.github.io/WorldScript-Studio/**","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:00.398Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:00.398Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:00.398Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:00.398Z","stars":21,"forks":7}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Local-first, offline-capable, AI-assisted creative writing studio for novels, screenplays, worlds, characters, research, revision, and export.","WorldScript Studio is an open-source creative-writing workspace designed around three principles:","WorldScript Studio combines a manuscript editor, visual plot planning, character and world dossiers, story-bible tooling, research and revision surfaces, progress analytics, AI writing tools, local inference, collaboration, publishing/export workflows, and a Tauri desktop shell in one project-centered application."],"features":["Local-first project ownership — there is no WorldScript user account or central manuscript database. Project state is stored locally in the browser/PWA or in the desktop app's local data directory.","Offline-capable core writing — once the PWA shell is cached, writing, planning, project management, and many analysis tools rem